   "body": "Order at launch (from the #446 review): build `SyncedSettingsStore` **after** the LOT-067 legacy import; its first launch runs the initial-sync rule (device values first, then the cloud, ADR 0013 §5 step 2). If the import must run later, call `apply(SyncedStoreChange(reason: .initialSync))` right after it.",
